<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling strengthens on dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling strengthens on dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling strengthened against the dollar and pound on Wednesday, the central Bank of Tanzania (B0T) said.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling stood at a commercial mean rate of 624.7890 from 628.8880 on Tuesday. The shilling traded at mean rate 1018.3133 against the pound from 1019.8204 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
